Sleep 2s
Type "2"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@120s /Choose:\s*$/
Sleep 2s
Wait@180s /psql done/
Sleep 2s
Type "C"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@120s /Choose:\s*$/
Sleep 3s
Type "0"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@120s /Choose:\s*$/
Sleep 2s
Type "0"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@120s /jumdar\? \(y\/n\):\s*$/
Sleep 0.7s
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@120s /Choose:\s*$/
Sleep 2s
Type "0"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Wait@60s />\s*$/
Sleep 0.7s
Type "Get-Content C:\Demo\live\02-deactivate-admin.sql"
Enter
Wait@120s />\s*$/
Sleep 2s
